{"id":"639135","name":"茴香肉包","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/639135/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茴香菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"300g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茴香菜、洋葱。","img":"images/639135/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉。","img":"images/639135/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把所有食材切(搅)碎，放入盆中。","img":"images/639135/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入包子馅调料拌匀，放冰箱备用。","img":"images/639135/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"g面粉加入5g酵母粉和白糖。","img":"images/639135/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入清水搅成絮状。","img":"images/639135/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下手揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/639135/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，发酵30分钟。","img":"images/639135/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面团发酵2倍大。","img":"images/639135/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉搓排气，搓成长条，再切成小剂子。","img":"images/639135/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取一个小剂子按扁。","img":"images/639135/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成薄片。","img":"images/639135/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/639135/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/639135/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包子捏好了。","img":"images/639135/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"依次全部做完。","img":"images/639135/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"入锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/639135/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"时间到，焖五分钟再开盖，防止塌陷回缩。","img":"images/639135/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。外皮松软，馅料也香喷喷的。","img":"images/639135/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}